{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"club","model_identifier":"club","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## club\n\nOne-handed weapon, hardwood.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.8..2.8, y -2.8..2.8, z -25.0..4.5 (size 5.5 x 5.5 x 29.5 u = 15 x 15 x 83 cm).\nKnobbly hardwood club, about 70 cm (29.5 u incl. butt): leather-wrapped grip, thickening neck, heavy head with knots. Grip at the origin, head 17-25 u forward (-Z). One-handed. Also the starting warrior's backup weapon: hung at slot_hip_l (origin at the slot, rotate the item so the head points down).\n"},"description":"## club\n\nOne-handed weapon, hardwood.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.8..2.8, y -2.8..2.8, z -25.0..4.5 (size 5.5 x 5.5 x 29.5 u = 15 x 15 x 83 cm).\nKnobbly hardwood club, about 70 cm (29.5 u incl. butt): leather-wrapped grip, thickening neck, heavy head with knots. Grip at the origin, head 17-25 u forward (-Z). One-handed. Also the starting warrior's backup weapon: hung at slot_hip_l (origin at the slot, rotate the item so the head points down).\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-0.75,-11.0],"to":[0.75,0.75,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,23,7.5,24.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,18,26.0,19.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8,23,9.5,24.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,21,14.0,22.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1.5,14.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2,0,3.5,14.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f7a1377d-b153-5076-a3ac-401fd82ae1ac"},{"name":"butt","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"re